Subject: [CANDIDATE] UML private syscall sites and GS-free runner trampoline

Default off: uml_syscall_patch=1. Work in progress; not correctness-gated.

Writable __access_remote_vm calls restore affected private sites before mmap_lock,
holding the per-mm patch mutex through the write. Single stepping restores all
sites and disables further rewriting in that mm until exec. Guest text readers
(including ptrace and /proc/pid/mem) can observe patched bytes.

